#: contents/ui/ConfigCustom.qml:198
msgid ""
"Commands run with sh, so pipes and && work. A status command tells the tile "
"whether it is on: exit code 0 means on. Without one, the tile remembers the "
"state you last set. Commands that keep running (a server, a program) should "
"be started with something that returns, like systemctl --user start or "
"setsid -f."
msgstr ""
"Perintah dijalankan dengan sh, jadi pipe dan && bisa dipakai. Perintah "
"status memberi tahu ubin apakah sedang menyala: kode keluar 0 berarti "
"menyala. Tanpa perintah status, ubin mengingat keadaan terakhir yang Anda "
"atur. Perintah yang terus berjalan (server, program) harus dimulai dengan "
"sesuatu yang langsung kembali, seperti systemctl --user start atau setsid -f."

#: contents/ui/ConfigCustom.qml:209
msgid ""
"The commands run as you, with your permissions. Only use commands you "
"understand and trust."
msgstr ""
"Perintah dijalankan sebagai Anda, dengan izin Anda. Gunakan hanya perintah "
"yang Anda pahami dan percayai."

